# Anthiel frontend

Use skill **`anthiel-frontend`** for full procedures. This rule is ambient law.

## Structure

Features under `apps/<web|backoffice|online-order>/src/features/<feature>/`.

- **Orval (preferred):** `components/`, `validators/`, page, `index.ts` — hooks from `@/generated/api`
- **Hand-written:** `data/{api,hooks,models}.ts`, components, page

## Golden paths

| Task | Do |
| --- | --- |
| New CRUD page | Skill `anthiel-frontend` → `references/feature-module.md` |
| Data table | Skill → `references/data-table.md` |
| API change | `cd apps/<app> && bun run api:generate` — never hand-edit `src/generated/api/**` |
| Dialog/drawer | Skill → `references/ui-dialogs.md` (Header → Panel → Footer) |

## Style

- Named exports; `function Foo()`; `type` for types
- Lists: TanStack Table + shared `DataTable` — no raw `<table>`
- Columns in dedicated `*-columns.tsx` file
- Toasts: sonner; icons: lucide-react
- Copy dicts for user-facing strings (`anthiel-copy.mdc`)
